      "fix": "Add a Text label \"Email address\" above the TextInput, assign a nativeID (e.g., \"emailInput\"), link the label via accessibilityLabelledBy, provide an accessibilityLabel on the TextInput, and ensure a testID is set for automated tests. Include placeholder and live validation as defined in DESIGN.md."
